# Nightly build blocklist
#
# Nightly builds Debian and Ubuntu minimal images for every Supported
# (.conf / .wip) board. List a board here only to skip it.
#
# Boards built from targets-release-nightly.manual instead:
#   - uefi-*: cloud images
#   - khadas-vim1s, khadas-vim4: edge images with the oowow extension
#
uefi-arm64
uefi-arm64-dt
uefi-loong64
uefi-x86
khadas-vim1s
khadas-vim4
